/-!
Integrability bookkeeping for the stochastic-gradient model of Bottou--Curtis--Nocedal,
Section 4, PDF pp. 22--24, Algorithm 4.1 and Assumptions 4.1/4.3.
These bridges derive moments from the explicit run fields, without extra hypotheses.
